{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04745","headline":"恩赐乐游园宴 · 张说","name":"恩赐乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉苑佳游地，轩庭近侍臣。\n共持荣幸日，来赏艳阳春。\n馔玉颁王篚，摐金下帝钧。\n池台草色徧，宫观柳条新。\n花绶光连榻，朱颜畅饮醇。\n圣朝多乐事，天意每随人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}